  "id": "recreation",
  "term": "recreation",
  "definition": "Recreation refers to voluntary activities people do in their leisure time, whether active or passive, for enjoyment, wellbeing, relief from everyday routine, and personal growth. In psychology and social contexts, it is also associated with rest, health maintenance, social interaction, and the development of skills such as cooperation and communication.",
